      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Remove Background (Lucida)\n\nAdaptation of https://github.com/egeorcun/lucida created by egeorcun (`docs/comfyui/lucida_remove_background.json`), flattened so it runs without a subgraph.\n\nLucida is a BiRefNet-HR fine-tune aimed at the mattes plain BiRefNet struggles with: semi-transparent objects (glass, glow), camouflaged subjects, text and logos with shadows, illustrations, and print-style designs. Model MIT, same as BiRefNet.\n\n### Profile\n\n```dotenv\nCOMFY_ASSET_PROFILES=lucida-background-removal\n```\n\n### Model link\n\n**background_removal**\n\n- [lucida.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/lucida.safetensors)\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 background_removal/\n│       └── lucida.safetensors\n```\n\nThe copy in `Comfy-Org/BiRefNet` can lag behind releases. For the newest weights download [model.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/egeorcun/lucida/resolve/main/model.safetensors) from [egeorcun/lucida](https://huggingface.co/egeorcun/lucida) and save it over `lucida.safetensors`.\n\n### Outputs\n\n`Save Image` writes a cut-out PNG with a real alpha channel. The mask preview on the right is the foreground matte on its own, useful as a control input elsewhere."
      ],
      "title": "Lucida — credit and model link",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
